        "id": 29665,
        "name": "flamethrower49",
        "username": "flamethrower49",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/838e76/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-09T18:28:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You’ll never make people happy, I tell you.  He better not have a guitar solo, I hope he has a guitar.  Fuss fuss fuss.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>\n<p>Love the character.  There’s a very good chance he’ll be my favorite to play.  However, I’ll have to agree with disliking the name.  You can’t shorten it.  “The Adept?”  “Adept?”  “Argie?”  Calling him “The Argent Adept” does not roll off the tongue.  Everybody else is catchy.</p>",
