        "cooked": "<p>He really is awesome, just a total blast to play - if you enjoy complex mechanics. <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>\n<p>I’ve been calling him “the Adept”, although that may evolve as we use him more.</p>",
