        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lugaru/{size}/2767_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-09T19:30:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I’m excited about Adept… I like the concept of a hero like that. My own character for City of Heroes, Champions Online and DC Universe Online is an 80’s rocker named “The Vocalist” which is similar to Marvel’s Banshee. I might print up an “alternate hero” card once the expansion comes out with a screenshot from one of those games. I’m guessing Adept is something closer to a Dr. Strange with music themes, but still it would be cool.</p>",
