      {
        "id": 29672,
        "name": "Blossercubbles",
        "username": "Blossercubbles",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/blossercubbles/{size}/1863_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-11T03:23:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;flamethrower49&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"flamethrower49\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Love the character.  There’s a very good chance he’ll be my favorite to play.  However, I’ll have to agree with disliking the name.  You can’t shorten it.  “The Adept?”  “Adept?”  “Argie?”  Calling him “The Argent Adept” does not roll off the tongue.  Everybody else is catchy.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I give pet names to most of the characters around the table. Legassy, Fanny Pack, Rat, Ra’s Al Ghul or Ray, Tacky, Abs, Bunky…I think Argie will fit right in place around here. Or, maybe ARRRRchie!</p>",
        "post_number": 26,
